data: {"id": "1fc3ab4a311e439b-thinking-parallel_evidence-798", "run_id": "1fc3ab4a311e439b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Now I have all the evidence needed to summarize. Let me compile the findings.\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v06/workload` (UID: `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`)\n- **节点**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **容器**: `app` (镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **当前阶段**: **Pending**，`ContainerCreating` 原因持续\n\n### 支持的证据（根因已确认）\n1. **事件明确指向 HostPath 卷挂载失败**: `FailedMount` (x7 over 63s)，原文为 `hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789126770711, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

